      "writtenOn": "2023-10-24T12:15:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if this is the right place for this? Our teardown logic is very complex, especially with unregisterAfterReplacement and delayed teardown.\n\nIn particular, when unregisterAfterReplacement is used, destroyNetwork is called much before this code runs. It seems like maybe we should call maybeDisableForwardRulesForDisconnectingNai in destroyNetwork instead of here?\n\nNot sure though what would happen if then that network is selected by some other local network\u0027s upstream. Maybe the forwarding rule code should check whether the upstream isDestroyed() and if so do nothing?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4941,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 4941,
        "endChar": 51
      },
      "revId": "f88210634d5658f9f0108e7193d100dd6e8b774e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0540135e_0003e5b7",
        "filename": "service/src/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java",
        "patchSetId": 21
      },
      "lineNbr": 4941,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-31T12:19:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. This still needs to be done here – in destroyNetwork(), it\u0027s too late if this wasn\u0027t unregisteredAfterReplacement because the requests will have been all unregistered and CS no longer knows what was the satisfier. But doing it in both places, combined with a test for isDestroyed() when setting up the forward and ignoring duplicate removes in RoutingCoordinatorManager makes for better behavior (e.g. not removing and adding back the same forward when replacing with the same interface name) and it\u0027s easier to use than to mandate always exact pairs of add/remove forwards.",
      "parentUuid": "46a9439d_802e6383",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4941,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 4941,
        "endChar": 51
      },
      "revId": "f88210634d5658f9f0108e7193d100dd6e8b774e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "98f244ac_5bc772c2",
        "filename": "service/src/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java",
