      "writtenOn": "2023-10-24T12:15:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you could make this code easier to read by removing the registerAgent boolean and having the caller pass in nai, oldConfig, and newConfig.\n\nhandleRegisterNetworkAgent would do:\n\n    updateLocalNetworkConfig(nai, null, nai.localNetworkConfig);\n\nand EVENT_LOCAL_NETWORK_CONFIG_CHANGED would do:\n\n    updateLocalNetworkConfig(nai, nai.localNetworkConfig, config);\n\nI think it would not only be easier to read but consistent with what we do in other methods such as updateLinkProperties.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8985,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 8985,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "f88210634d5658f9f0108e7193d100dd6e8b774e",
