      "writtenOn": "2023-10-31T12:19:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure what other way you mean ? A NetworkRequest only has a NetworkCapabilities object ; more than the numeric capabilites can change (e.g. the transport or bandwidth requirement) but these are included in `requestUpdated` since it\u0027s seeded with Object.equals(oldCaps, newCaps), not just the numeric capabilities.\n\nDid you have anything specific in mind that this code is failing to update for ?",
      "parentUuid": "4fc5e7c8_31f3b4c0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8987,
        "startChar": 34,
